law.text:
		The Board shall consider the following when selecting localities for program participation and in determining grant allocations:

Present and future beach ownership;


Erosion caused by public navigational works;


Intensity of use;


Availability of public beaches in the vicinity;


Evidence of a locality's ability and willingness to develop a long-term capacity to combat erosion;


Rate of erosion;


Actions of a locality which lead to, or may result in, the erosion of beaches; and


Such other matters as the Board shall deem sufficient for consideration.
